      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Wan 2.2 A14B image-to-video - dual expert (high-noise + low-noise).\n\nToggle nodes with Ctrl+B. Purple = bypassed = OFF.\n\nREALISTIC (default) -> nothing to change.\n\nANIME -> un-bypass the 3 'anime helper' LoRAs on the LOW expert\n         (livewallpaper / Live2d_Background / 2D_animation_effects, 0.3 each).\n         LOW-noise only, on purpose.\n\nQUALITY -> steps 4 -> 10 AND cfg 1.0 -> 3.5 on BOTH samplers,\n         AND bypass BOTH Lightning LoRAs.\n         Lightning is CFG-DISTILLED and only valid at cfg 1.0. Raising cfg with\n         Lightning still on fights the distillation. Expect ~5x the render time.\n\nSPEED -> SageAttention build ~246s vs ~346s plain, on RX 7900 XTX / ROCm.\n         Do NOT remove the 'UNLOAD UNET BEFORE DECODE' node (~95s on its own)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
